abstract: "RGB-D observations of transparent laboratory vessels with instance, visible-part, functional-region, and contact-policy annotations. Includes 7 categories, 30 physical objects, 356 RGB-D pairs and 419 annotated instances. Version 1.0.0 preserves the data content of the local 0.1.0-draft."
keywords:
  - transparent laboratory vessels
  - RGB-D
  - visible parts
  - functional regions
  - contact policy
